  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Australia Awards Pacific Scholarship - 2019 Intake</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Australia Awards Pacific Scholarships are long term, multi-country awards administered by the Department of Foreign Affairs and Trade. AAPS enables recipients from Pacific Island countries to undertake undergraduate, postgraduate, technical, vocational and educational training (TVET) studies at selected Pacific regional institutions annually, aligned to bilateral and regional agreements and priorities of Pacific Island Governments. The study and research opportunities provided through AAPS develops the skills and knowledge of individuals to drive changes and contribute to development in the Pacific region.</narrative>
  </description>
